    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22847" root="شكل" body-key="$">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استشكلهُ</span></b>  is often used by the learned in the
present day as meaning <i>He deemed it</i> (i. e. a word
or phrase or sentence) <i>dubious,</i> or <i>confused.</i>]

